    # game/BKinit_variables.rpy:1922
    old "She moans as she feels the caress of her clothing rubbing against her soft skin. Looking straight into your eyes, she slowly removes her underwear last, inch by inch, making sure to give you a good show."
    new "她呻吟着，感受着衣物摩擦着她柔软的肌肤。她直视着你的眼睛，最后缓缓脱下内衣，一寸一寸，确保给你带来一场精彩的表演。"

    # game/BKinit_variables.rpy:1923
    old "Whining and bitching, she reluctantly takes off her clothes, hiding her private parts in embarrassment. She looks angry and shameful."
    new "她一边抱怨一边不情愿地脱掉衣服，羞愧地遮住私处。她看起来既生气又羞愧。"

    # TODO game/BKinit_variables.rpy:1993
