    # game/BKspells.rpy:75
    old "Now, who would have thought of using a magic wand for that..."
    new "谁会想到用魔杖来做这件事呢……"

    # game/BKspells.rpy:76
    old "Now, did you know there is a 5th dimension? And a 6th, and a 7th, and a 13th?"
