    # game/BKstory_events.rpy:5451
    old "The merchandise is brought to the guild quarter on the first Tuesday of every month. Look for a private club called 'Mania', and show them the amulet.\n\nDon't expect any more intel from me, this is getting too dangerous. My cover is nearly blown, I'm out."
    new "货物每月第一个星期二运到公会区。找到一家名为“狂热”的私人俱乐部，把护身符给他们看。\n\n别指望我能提供更多情报，这太危险了。我的身份快要暴露了，我得走了。"

    # game/BKstory_events.rpy:17942
    old "Dear Bill,\n\nI haven't slept or eaten since you've left me. I am so alone in this world.\nYou've left me with so many questions. Did you ever love me?\nI will be punished for what you did, but it's punishment I will gladly accept, because I love you. All I want is for you to give me a sign. I'll betray the Order if I have to. I'll steal for you if I must.\n\nDon't leave me, my love. I will do anything."
    new "亲爱的比尔，\n\n自从你离开后，我便夜不能寐，食不下咽。我在这世上如此孤独。\n你留给我太多疑问。你爱过我吗？\n我会为你的所作所为受到惩罚，但我甘愿接受，因为我爱你。我只想要你给我一个信号。如果必须，我会背叛教团。如果必须，我会为你偷窃。\n\n我的爱人，请不要离开我。我愿意为你做任何事。"

